@@ -21,6 +21,11 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape commands
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (a portfolio view aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root). It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands, e.g.: `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>` creates `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the report.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape` (kept for backward compatibility), with the same options.
+
